<p>Hi <%= @submission.contact_name %>,</p>

<p>Thanks for submitting to CHILLFILTR®. We've received your payment and the following
<%= pluralize(@submission.song_count, "track") %> from <strong><%= @submission.artist_name %></strong>:</p>

<ul>
  <% @submission.submission_songs.each do |song| %>
    <li><%= song.title %></li>
  <% end %>
</ul>

<p>Total paid: $<%= sprintf("%.2f", @submission.amount_dollars) %></p>

<p>We listen to everything that comes in. If it's a fit for our radio channel, we'll be in touch.</p>

<p>— CHILLFILTR®</p>
